/S /Figure
/Alt (UML sequence diagram for AI Cost Autopilot A coding agent posts a chat completion to the gateway. The gateway snapshots the request, computes signals and asks the autopilot for a plan. If caching is allowed it looks up the cache and returns early on a hit. Otherwise it optionally trims, forwards through the provider module to the mock or the real LLM, stores the response under the original request, records metrics and returns. A second frame shows the dashboard polling the gateway for statistics.)
